<title>JAPAN: Japan 10-yr JGB auction lowest price 100.50.</title>
<headline>Japan 10-yr JGB auction lowest price 100.50.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 2.7 percent 192nd 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) auction, covering 60 percent of the one trillion yen issue, were as follows, the Ministry of Finance said on Thursday:</p>
<p> Lowest price	 100.50   Stop rate     2.636 pct</p>
<p> Average price	100.53   Average yield 2.633 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   2.6574 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	590.83 billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 61.3927 pct</p>
<p> Issue date   Jan 27, 1997   Maturity   Mar 20, 2007</p>
</text>
